page registry {
  i18n {
    check-chain-label { en "On-chain stakes" zh "链上质押" }
    check-chain-value { en "Chain explorer / general SDK: list stakes where receiver = the factory address (the public projection is on ?page=factory, record node/factories.json)" zh "链上浏览器 / 通用 SDK：查询 receiver = 工厂地址的质押列表（公开投影见 ?page=factory，记录 node/factories.json）" }
    check-cli-label { en "Registry projection (CLI)" zh "注册表投影（CLI）" }
    check-desc { en "This page renders the projection node/registry.json; verify it against the chain itself — list stakes where receiver = the factory address with a chain explorer or a general SDK, and never trust a number this page cannot source." zh "本页渲染的是投影 node/registry.json；请与链上核对——用链上浏览器或通用 SDK 查询 receiver = 工厂地址的质押列表，不要信任何本页无法给出出处的数字。" }
    check-title { en "How to verify" zh "核对入口" }
    desc { en "Which nodes are staked to this node's studio factory — the on-chain registry view. The page reads the public projection node/registry.json, which the CLI writes from the chain query (listStakes, probes P-1/P-2 verified 2026-10-01); it carries public fields only, never key material." zh "质押到本节点 studio 工厂的节点列表——链上注册表面。本页读取公开投影 node/registry.json；投影由 CLI 查询链上注册表（listStakes，探针 P-1/P-2 已于 2026-10-01 验证）写入，只含公开字段，绝无密钥材料。" }
    gate-desc { en "Sign in with DID Wallet to view the registry status." zh "使用 DID Wallet 登录后查看注册表状态。" }
    gate-title { en "Node registry" zh "节点注册表" }
    list-title { en "Staked nodes" zh "质押节点" }
    login { en "Sign in with DID Wallet" zh "使用 DID Wallet 登录" }
    node-assets { en "Staked assets" zh "质押资产数" }
    node-data-updated { en "Last data update" zh "最近一次 data 更新时间" }
    node-endpoint { en "Endpoint" zh "Endpoint" }
    node-owner { en "Owner" zh "Owner" }
    node-reach-label { en "Reachability" zh "时效" }
    node-reach-note { en "Basis" zh "依据" }
    node-stake { en "Stake address" zh "质押地址" }
    pending-cli-label { en "Generate the projection (CLI)" zh "生成投影（CLI）" }
    pending-note { en "This page renders only what the projection node/registry.json says. The state line below is computed by the CLI (the AUP expression layer cannot compare or concatenate, so the page only prints the string): it distinguishes not-yet-generated / a sourced empty state / the node list, and it states the remedy for the first and second. A projection with no live node is NOT an assertion about the whole chain — it means this factory has no live stake row (dead rows, `assets` empty next to a non-empty `revokedAssets`, are excluded), so the count is live nodes, not raw stake rows." zh "本页只渲染投影 node/registry.json 说的内容。下方状态行由 CLI 计算（AUP 表达式层不能比较、不能拼接，本页只打印字符串）：区分 未生成 / 有出处的空态 / 节点列表，并对前两者给出恢复路径。投影里没有存活节点不等于断言整条链上没有节点——它只表示本工厂名下没有存活质押行（失活行 = assets 为空且 revokedAssets 非空，不计入），因此计数是存活节点，不是原始质押行数。" }
    probe-p1-label { en "Probe P-1 (mock-chain enumeration)" zh "探针 P-1（mock 链枚举）" }
    probe-p1-value { en "Verified (2026-10-01, mock adapter): returned count = staked count, unstaked nodes absent, cursor pagination continues." zh "已验证通过（2026-10-01，mock 适配器）：返回条数 = 质押数、未质押的不出现、分页游标可续。" }
    probe-p2-label { en "Probe P-2 (beta real-chain enumeration)" zh "探针 P-2（beta 真链枚举）" }
    probe-p2-value { en "Verified (2026-10-01, ocap adapter on beta): the minimal query shape addressFilter.receiver + paging.{size,cursor} is accepted and the cursor paginates." zh "已验证通过（2026-10-01，ocap 适配器，beta 真链）：最小查询形参 addressFilter.receiver + paging.{size,cursor} 被接受、游标可分页。" }
    reach-labels { en "Four reachability states (PRD-NET-03): reachable / stale / never / offline — fixed names, never renamed." zh "可达性四态（PRD-NET-03）：可达 / 陈旧 / 从未可达 / 离线——固定命名，不得新造词。" }
    status-title { en "Connection status" zh "接入状态" }
    status-wired { en "Wired end to end: the adapters enumerate the chain registry (listStakes — P-1 mock / P-2 ocap, both verified 2026-10-01), the CLI's registry refresh writes the projection, and this page renders it. The chain remains the source of truth — a refresh re-reads it." zh "已端到端接通：适配器层枚举链上注册表（listStakes——P-1 mock / P-2 ocap，均于 2026-10-01 验证），CLI 的 registry refresh 写入投影，本页渲染投影。链上仍是事实来源——刷新即重新读取。" }
    title { en "Node registry" zh "节点注册表" }
  }
  view gap=lg style={height: "calc(100vh - 48px)", overflow: visible} {
    view style={gap: "0"} {
      view gap=sm style={background: "var(--card-bg)", border: "var(--card-border)", borderRadius: "var(--radius-lg, 10px)", padding: "20px"} visible="!$session.authenticated" {
        h2 :gate-title level=2 style={fontSize: "var(--type-body)"}
        p :gate-desc intent=muted
        row cross=start {
          action -> navigate "/.well-known/service/login?return_to=%2F%3Fpage%3Dregistry&cancel_to=%2F%3Fpage%3Dregistry" variant=primary label=:login style={borderRadius: "var(--radius-md, 8px)"}
        }
      }
      row gap=lg cross=stretch style={width: "100vw", marginLeft: "calc(50% - 50vw)", height: "calc(100vh - 48px)", marginBottom: "-52px", padding: "0 32px 0 0"} visible=$session.authenticated {
        view size={width: "clamp(200px, 15vw, 280px)", flexShrink: 0, height: "100%"} style={padding: "0", background: "var(--color-surface)", borderRight: "1px solid var(--color-border)", overflowY: auto, gap: "0", height: "100%"} visible=$session.authenticated {
          p "$t(wrapper.nav-group-content)" intent=muted scale=caption style={padding: "10px 20px 4px", background: "var(--color-bg)", flexShrink: 0}
          action "$t(wrapper.nav-dashboard)" -> page dashboard style={border: none, borderRadius: "0", padding: "8px 20px 8px 32px", justifyContent: flex-start, flexShrink: 0}
          view style={height: "1px", background: "var(--color-border)", flexShrink: 0} {
            p " "
          }
          action "$t(wrapper.nav-studio)" -> page posts style={border: none, borderRadius: "0", padding: "8px 20px 8px 32px", justifyContent: flex-start, flexShrink: 0}
          view style={height: "1px", background: "var(--color-border)", flexShrink: 0} {
            p " "
          }
          action "$t(wrapper.nav-pages)" -> page pages style={border: none, borderRadius: "0", padding: "8px 20px 8px 32px", justifyContent: flex-start, flexShrink: 0}
          view style={height: "1px", background: "var(--color-border)", flexShrink: 0} {
            p " "
          }
          action "$t(wrapper.nav-write)" -> page compose style={border: none, borderRadius: "0", padding: "8px 20px 8px 32px", justifyContent: flex-start, flexShrink: 0}
          view style={height: "1px", background: "var(--color-border)", flexShrink: 0} {
            p " "
          }
          p "$t(wrapper.nav-group-site)" intent=muted scale=caption style={padding: "10px 20px 4px", background: "var(--color-bg)", flexShrink: 0}
          action "$t(wrapper.nav-heroes)" -> page heroes style={border: none, borderRadius: "0", padding: "8px 20px 8px 32px", justifyContent: flex-start, flexShrink: 0}
          view style={height: "1px", background: "var(--color-border)", flexShrink: 0} {
            p " "
          }
          action "$t(wrapper.nav-categories)" -> page categories style={border: none, borderRadius: "0", padding: "8px 20px 8px 32px", justifyContent: flex-start, flexShrink: 0}
          view style={height: "1px", background: "var(--color-border)", flexShrink: 0} {
            p " "
          }
          action "$t(wrapper.nav-tags)" -> page tags style={border: none, borderRadius: "0", padding: "8px 20px 8px 32px", justifyContent: flex-start, flexShrink: 0}
          view style={height: "1px", background: "var(--color-border)", flexShrink: 0} {
            p " "
          }
          action "$t(wrapper.nav-seo)" -> page seo style={border: none, borderRadius: "0", padding: "8px 20px 8px 32px", justifyContent: flex-start, flexShrink: 0}
          view style={height: "1px", background: "var(--color-border)", flexShrink: 0} {
            p " "
          }
          action "$t(wrapper.nav-feeds)" -> page feeds style={border: none, borderRadius: "0", padding: "8px 20px 8px 32px", justifyContent: flex-start, flexShrink: 0}
          view style={height: "1px", background: "var(--color-border)", flexShrink: 0} {
            p " "
          }
          p "$t(wrapper.nav-group-ops)" intent=muted scale=caption style={padding: "10px 20px 4px", background: "var(--color-bg)", flexShrink: 0}
          action "$t(wrapper.nav-operations)" -> page operations style={border: none, borderRadius: "0", padding: "8px 20px 8px 32px", justifyContent: flex-start, flexShrink: 0}
          view style={height: "1px", background: "var(--color-border)", flexShrink: 0} {
            p " "
          }
          action "$t(wrapper.nav-registry)" -> page registry active=true style={border: none, borderRadius: "0", padding: "8px 20px 8px 32px", justifyContent: flex-start, flexShrink: 0}
          view style={height: "1px", background: "var(--color-border)", flexShrink: 0} {
            p " "
          }
          action "$t(wrapper.nav-factory)" -> page factory style={border: none, borderRadius: "0", padding: "8px 20px 8px 32px", justifyContent: flex-start, flexShrink: 0}
          view style={height: "1px", background: "var(--color-border)", flexShrink: 0} {
            p " "
          }
          action "$t(wrapper.nav-media)" -> page media style={border: none, borderRadius: "0", padding: "8px 20px 8px 32px", justifyContent: flex-start, flexShrink: 0}
          view style={height: "1px", background: "var(--color-border)", flexShrink: 0} {
            p " "
          }
          action "$t(wrapper.nav-agents)" -> page agents style={border: none, borderRadius: "0", padding: "8px 20px 8px 32px", justifyContent: flex-start, flexShrink: 0}
          view style={height: "1px", background: "var(--color-border)", flexShrink: 0} {
            p " "
          }
          p "$t(wrapper.nav-group-settings)" intent=muted scale=caption style={padding: "10px 20px 4px", background: "var(--color-bg)", flexShrink: 0}
          action "$t(wrapper.nav-settings)" -> page general style={border: none, borderRadius: "0", padding: "8px 20px 8px 32px", justifyContent: flex-start, flexShrink: 0}
          view style={height: "1px", background: "var(--color-border)", flexShrink: 0} {
            p " "
          }
          action "$t(wrapper.nav-diagnostics)" -> page diagnostics style={border: none, borderRadius: "0", padding: "8px 20px 8px 32px", justifyContent: flex-start, flexShrink: 0}
          view gap=xs style={padding: "10px 20px 10px 32px", background: "var(--color-bg)", borderTop: "1px solid var(--color-border)", flexShrink: 0} visible="!$session.isAdmin" {
            p "$t(wrapper.admin-notice)" scale=caption intent=muted
          }
        }
        view gap=md size={flex: 1} style={paddingTop: "14px", paddingBottom: "14px", minHeight: 0} {
          view gap=lg style={height: "100%", minHeight: 0} visible=$session.authenticated {
            h2 :title level=2 style={fontSize: "var(--type-subheading)"}
            p :desc intent=muted
            view gap=sm size={flex: 1} style={overflowY: auto} {
              view gap=sm style={background: "var(--card-bg)", border: "var(--card-border)", borderRadius: "var(--radius-lg, 10px)", boxShadow: none, padding: "14px", flexShrink: 0} {
                h3 :status-title level=3 style={fontSize: "var(--type-body)"}
                p :status-wired intent=muted
                p :reach-labels intent=muted scale=sm
                key-value-list dense=true fields=[{label: "$t(registry.probe-p1-label)", value: "$t(registry.probe-p1-value)"}, {label: "$t(registry.probe-p2-label)", value: "$t(registry.probe-p2-value)"}]
                h3 :check-title level=3 style={fontSize: "var(--type-body)"}
                p :check-desc intent=muted
                key-value-list dense=true fields=[{label: "$t(registry.check-cli-label)", value: "node scripts/arcblog-network.mjs registry show", monospace: true, copyable: true}, {label: "$t(registry.check-chain-label)", value: "$t(registry.check-chain-value)"}]
              }
              view gap=sm style={background: "var(--card-bg)", border: "var(--card-border)", borderRadius: "var(--radius-lg, 10px)", boxShadow: none, padding: "14px", flexShrink: 0} {
                h3 :list-title level=3 style={fontSize: "var(--type-body)"}
                p :pending-note intent=info scale=sm
                key-value-list dense=true fields=[{label: "$t(registry.pending-cli-label)", value: "node scripts/arcblog-network.mjs registry refresh", monospace: true, copyable: true}]
                // DEF-22 / B14: this console page lives at `/?page=registry`
                // (pathname `/`), so no `afs:` binding matches and `$state.loc` does
                // not exist — the projection is read through a LITERAL `surface url`
                // instead of `propBind`, which only binds after the first render.
                // The projection's own precomputed strings (`stateNote` / `ownNote`)
                // are printed by the recipe, never re-derived here.
                surface url="/instance/app/arcblog/node/registry.json" editable=false {
                  p :reach-labels scale=sm intent=muted
                }
                view gap=sm {
                  afs-list registry-nodes layout=list itemStyle=row subscribe=true showBreadcrumb=false showParent=false autoSelect=false clickMode=none pagination=manual pageSize=10 from "/instance/app/arcblog/node/registry" {
                    row gap=sm cross=center role=item {
                      view gap=xs style={flex: "1 1 0%"} {
                        row gap=xs cross=center {
                          p :node-reach-label scale=sm intent=muted
                          p "${entry.content.reachabilityLabel}" scale=sm
                        }
                        row gap=xs cross=center {
                          p :node-reach-note scale=sm intent=muted
                          p "${entry.content.reachabilityReason}" scale=sm
                        }
                        row gap=xs cross=center {
                          p :node-endpoint scale=sm intent=muted
                          p "${entry.content.endpoint}" scale=sm
                        }
                        row gap=xs cross=center {
                          p :node-data-updated scale=sm intent=muted
                          p "${entry.content.dataUpdatedAt}" scale=sm
                        }
                        row gap=xs cross=center {
                          p :node-owner scale=sm intent=muted
                          p "${entry.content.owner}" scale=sm
                        }
                        row gap=xs cross=center {
                          p :node-stake scale=sm intent=muted
                          p "${entry.content.stakeAddress}" scale=sm
                        }
                        row gap=xs cross=center {
                          p :node-assets scale=sm intent=muted
                          p "${entry.content.assetCount}" scale=sm
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
